(7717554, 1269066, 101668, '<td valign="top">Although the sunflowers are a little orange on my monitor, I still love the image. I hope it does well for you</td>', 'Although the sunflowers are a little orange on my monitor, I still love the image. I hope it does well for you', '2022-03-25 10:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7717618, 1269096, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in your blues and yellows. The bottom third of the photo doesn''t have much interest. I''m a little curious if you played around with a different crop on it? Because the mountains and fog are really quite lovely.<br/> <br/>I probably would have rated it higher if you had tied the title to the challenge of solidarity. (just a thought)</td>', 'I love the tones in your blues and yellows. The bottom third of the photo doesn''t have much interest. I''m a little curious if you played around with a different crop on it? Because the mountains and fog are really quite lovely. I probably would have rated it higher if you had tied the title to the challenge of solidarity. (just a thought)', '2022-03-26 12:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7717619, 1269079, 103142, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge nicely.</td>', 'Meets the challenge nicely.', '2022-03-26 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7717621, 1268974, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m torn, because this is hitting me different ways. The photo is all right, probably a 5 or a 6, <br/> <br/>But I don''t think my feelings are "is prejudice, fear or hatred against Russia, the Russians, and Russian culture". I don''t quite think that being against a stronger group invading and destroying a weaker group is prejudice. Somehow I find it wrong bombing maternity hospitals, theaters, and civilians. So I don''t know whether to vote solely on the merits of the photo, or to vote on what the photo is saying. <br/> <br/>Since a photo is worth a thousand words, and this is a challenge on solidarity with Ukraine, I guess I''ll vote accordingly. <br/> <br/>Which brings me to the question -- if it was a solidarity with Russia challenge, and I disagreed with that, would I vote all those entries down? I always took offense at the people who were anti military and would automatically give anything military related a 1 regardless of the challenge. Or those who didn''t like extended editing, and gave anything extended a one regardless of it''s quality. <br/> <br/>Interesting thing to think about. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-03-28 08:04:56.</i></td>', 'I''m torn, because this is hitting me different ways. The photo is all right, probably a 5 or a 6,  But I don''t think my feelings are "is prejudice, fear or hatred against Russia, the Russians, and Russian culture". I don''t quite think that being against a stronger group invading and destroying a weaker group is prejudice. Somehow I find it wrong bombing maternity hospitals, theaters, and civilians. So I don''t know whether to vote solely on the merits of the photo, or to vote on what the photo is saying.  Since a photo is worth a thousand words, and this is a challenge on solidarity with Ukraine, I guess I''ll vote accordingly.  Which brings me to the question -- if it was a solidarity with Russia challenge, and I disagreed with that, would I vote all those entries down? I always took offense at the people who were anti military and would automatically give anything military related a 1 regardless of the challenge. Or those who didn''t like extended editing, and gave anything extended a one regardless of it''s quality.  Interesting thing to think about. ', '2022-03-26 12:41:17.000000', '2022-03-28 09:04:56.000000', 1),
(7717645, 1269041, 173844, '<td valign="top">Another masterful foray into the realm of our insect friends.  The detail is stunning.  The colors are definitive.  The woody bit the fly''s standing is interesting, as is the milky background.  The flash in his/her eye is somewhat distracting.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Another masterful foray into the realm of our insect friends.  The detail is stunning.  The colors are definitive.  The woody bit the fly''s standing is interesting, as is the milky background.  The flash in his/her eye is somewhat distracting.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2022-03-27 20:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7717646, 1269099, 173844, '<td valign="top">With the lit trees and reflections in the foreground, this is a becoming take on the Milky Way.  You do have to put in some work to nail down the blue and yellow, but they''re there and subtlety is not a fault.  And it is peaceful, amidst the horrors in Ukraine.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'With the lit trees and reflections in the foreground, this is a becoming take on the Milky Way.  You do have to put in some work to nail down the blue and yellow, but they''re there and subtlety is not a fault.  And it is peaceful, amidst the horrors in Ukraine.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2022-03-27 20:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7717649, 1269076, 173844, '<td valign="top">The soft colors look lovely.  The composition is interesting and, in my opinion, works.  Feels like better days coming.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'The soft colors look lovely.  The composition is interesting and, in my opinion, works.  Feels like better days coming.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2022-03-27 22:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
